	(descr "TI DLA0010A VSON-HR 10-pin, body 2.0 x 3.0 mm (outline 2.1/1.9 x 3.1/2.9), pitch 0.5 mm, 1 mm max height, no exposed pad. Package TPS63802DLAR/T. Land pattern is TI's 'Example Board Layout' and paste is TI's 'Example Stencil Design', both drawing 4223750/D (03/2019), TPS63802 datasheet SLVSEU9D (Rev. D) Package Option Addendum pp. 'EXAMPLE BOARD LAYOUT' / 'EXAMPLE STENCIL DESIGN', read from the rendered PDF pages: pins 1-5 lands 0.6 x 0.25 mm centred 0.9 mm left of the package centreline; pins 6,7,9,10 lands 0.9 x 0.25 mm centred 0.75 mm right; pin 8 land 1.3 x 0.25 mm (spans 0.11 mm left of centreline to 1.2 mm right, centre 0.55 mm right); 0.5 mm row pitch (2.0 mm between pin 1 and pin 6 rows' extremes). Pin 8 paste is two 0.55 x 0.25 apertures (0.75 mm total centre-to-centre) per the stencil drawing. Pin numbering: 1-5 down the left side top to bottom, 6-10 up the right side bottom to top.")
